      <h1>About this project</h1>
      <p>
        <code>astro-learning-lab</code> is a developer knowledge platform used as
        a teaching vehicle for Astro. It is built phase by phase, each phase introducing
        a small number of concepts with tests and documentation.
      </p>
      <h2>Principles</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>HTML first: zero client JavaScript unless a feature demands it.</li>
        <li>Rendering decisions are made per route.</li>
        <li>Every byte of client JS must justify itself.</li>
      </ul>
    </main>
